---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Contact | elderabusecalc.com';
const description = 'How to reach the editorial team at elderabusecalc.com for corrections, citations, and interview requests. For active abuse concerns, contact APS or the Eldercare Locator hotline.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>The editorial team welcomes corrections, citation suggestions, interview requests, and general feedback. We don&rsquo;t provide legal advice, don&rsquo;t review individual cases, and are not a substitute for Adult Protective Services.</p>

  <h2>If abuse is happening right now</h2>

  <p>Please do not email us with an active abuse concern &mdash; we are not equipped to respond quickly. Instead:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Emergency:</strong> call 911.</li>
    <li><strong>National Center on Elder Abuse / Eldercare Locator:</strong> <strong>1-800-677-1116</strong>. Connects you to your state&rsquo;s Adult Protective Services intake and other local resources.</li>
    <li><strong>State Long-Term Care Ombudsman:</strong> for nursing home or assisted living complaints. Find yours through the Eldercare Locator number above.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Editorial inquiries</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>. Please include the page URL when reporting a correction. We respond within a few business days.</p>

  <h2>What we can help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Corrections to published content (factual errors, outdated citations, broken links).</li>
    <li>Citation suggestions (peer-reviewed sources, recent appellate opinions, new state legislation).</li>
    <li>Interview requests from journalists or researchers.</li>
    <li>General feedback about the site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we can&rsquo;t help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Legal advice on your specific case (contact an elder abuse attorney).</li>
    <li>Medical advice (contact a qualified provider).</li>
    <li>Active abuse reports (contact APS or call 1-800-677-1116).</li>
    <li>Specific case valuations beyond the calculator&rsquo;s general ranges.</li>
    <li>Referrals to specific law firms or care facilities.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>For practical guidance</h2>
  <p>If you suspect elder abuse, see <a href="/guides/what-to-do-if-you-suspect-elder-abuse">what to do if you suspect elder abuse</a> for step-by-step guidance covering APS reporting, evidence preservation, and attorney consultation.</p>
</BaseLayout>
